scalafim.atlas.ParcelMetricInteropProducerSuite:
  + produce the platform metric document 0.024s
scalafim.atlas.AtlasProvenanceSuite:
  + AtlasRef converts to typed provenance with source artifacts, support, labels, and citations 0.006s
  + standard atlas provenance infers release metadata and readable summaries 0.012s
  + descriptor-only provenance is explicit and validation reports audit gaps 0.007s
  + loaded provenance records label filtering decisions 0.001s
  + license and voxel-size helpers round-trip legacy metadata 0.005s
  + source artifacts preserve restricted licenses and SHA digests in legacy export 0.001s
  + strict provenance validation flags missing source accounting 0.001s
scalafim.atlas.io.StandardSurfaceAtlasLoaderSuite:
  + FreeSurfer annotation sides are remapped to distinct canonical parcel ids 0.016s
  + annotation geometry coverage is checked before realization 0.001s
  + pinned bilateral Mills Glasser projection annotations verify and decode as fsaverage derivatives 0.942s
  + opt-in CBIG Schaefer pair verifies annotations and matching geometry receipts 0.419s
scalafim.atlas.SurfaceAtlasSuite:
  + SurfaceAtlas wraps bilateral labeled surfaces with typed region lookup 0.003s
  + surface template and coordinate spaces remain distinct in provenance and publication 0.005s
  + SurfaceAtlas validates geometry hemispheres 0.001s
  + SurfaceAtlas requires non-zero payload labels and region ids to match 0.002s
  + SurfaceAtlas rejects unused label-table ids 0.001s
  + SurfaceAtlas requires lateral hemisphere access and exposes label metadata 0.002s
  + SurfaceAtlas exposes parcel units, distances, and boundary contacts per hemisphere 0.03s
scalafim.atlas.SpaceTransformGraphSuite:
  + the standard manifest populates one spatial graph over unsampled template domains 0.044s
  + the internal affine route matches FreeSurfer mni152.register.dat 0.014s
  + TemplateFlow warps stay planned and typed non-executable until an asset implements them 0.011s
  + assets on frames outside the catalog are rejected when the graph is built 0.003s
  + routes fall back to exact inverses only when no forward route exists 0.005s
  + available steps without provider maps are planned but not executable 0.0s
  + grid pullbacks come from fused affine routes, including inverse steps 0.007s
  + grid pullbacks reject grids outside the route's endpoint worlds 0.002s
  + an identity route over an uncatalogued space plans, but has no world for grid pullbacks 0.001s
scalafim.atlas.AtlasExpandSuite:
  + coordinate-keyed neuroatlas oracle covers reordered, partial and background values 0.004s
  + expansion rejects foreign parcel owners at compilation 0.0s
scalafim.atlas.io.HcpExLoaderSuite:
  + HCPex parser rejects incomplete metadata 0.001s
scalafim.atlas.io.FslAtlasLoaderSuite:
  + probability-channel offset and literal label ids have distinct semantics 0.007s
  + FSL XML admits the optional shortname used by the pinned Juelich descriptor 0.001s
  + malformed, duplicate, empty, unsupported and external entity XML fails explicitly 0.005s
  + local paths must match expected source bytes 0.004s
  + optional source-backed qualification loads pinned families with coverage and provenance 0.84s
scalafim.atlas.io.SubcorticalAtlasQualificationSuite:
  + optional native CIT168 qualification 1.188s
  + optional native HCP thalamic qualification 1.15s
  + optional native MDTB10 qualification 0.179s
  + optional native HCP ROI qualification 0.511s
scalafim.atlas.AtlasRealizationSuite:
  + volume realization retains one direct partial surjection 0.005s
  + equal-size reordered and foreign parcel identities fail exact alignment 0.002s
  + retargeting a reordered parcel owner requires a certified bijection 0.003s
  + a volume realization rejects an image from a different live grid owner 0.002s
  + volume and bilateral surface share exact parcel identity 0.003s
scalafim.atlas.ParcelMetricSuite:
  + volume-to-surface restoration preserves origin and admits precise target fields 0.014s
  + origin namespace, ordering, schema and assignment evidence fail closed even with recomputed digest 0.051s
  + whole-payload integrity and independently retained digest detect value alteration 0.011s
  + decoded origins obey classified spaces and hard-label background admission 0.017s
  + unsorted source IDs preserve display order and canonical restoration 0.005s
  + foreign target domain, forged live owner and callback failures are explicit 0.009s
  + Float64 bit contract preserves signed zero, infinities, subnormals and finite extremes 0.006s
  + metric encoding rejects foreign field ownership at compilation 0.0s
scalafim.atlas.AtlasPublicationSuite:
  + Schaefer variants define exact ordered parcel identity 0.006s
  + volume support identity includes the exact grid 0.005s
  + surface support identity includes ordered topology but not coordinates 0.003s
  + bilateral publication retains one quotient and explicit empty fibers 0.001s
  + foreign-producer v1 fixture matches fixed domain and assignment bytes 0.003s
  + publication admission recomputes fingerprints and identity preimages 0.001s
  + publication admission rejects malformed support and assignments 0.002s
  + checked constructors preserve typed invalid-payload failures 0.003s
scalafim.atlas.AtlasInvariantSuite:
  + reference constructors and updates reject contradictory types at compile time 0.002s
  + realizations cannot be implemented outside the checked construction boundary 0.002s
  + metadata updates preserve the concrete reference type and fixed spaces 0.001s
  + checked space parsing canonicalizes known aliases and refuses opposite kinds 0.001s
  + dynamic reference admission checks both coordinate and template kinds 0.0s
  + metadata stores checked values and rejects invalid strings at construction 0.001s
  + parcel imports reject duplicate, missing and unknown source IDs 0.001s
  + direct and extension queries use the atlas native coordinates by default 0.008s
  + selection preserves exact spatial ownership and records canonical parent evidence 0.01s
  + empty selection is a typed error and selection identity distinguishes actual assignments 0.003s
scalafim.atlas.HcpExRequestSuite:
  + HCPex request preserves native resolution-specific immutable assets 0.001s
scalafim.atlas.io.SurfaceGiftiAtlasLoaderSuite:
  + loadFromPathsEither builds a bilateral SurfaceAtlas from GIFTI label payloads 0.127s
  + loadFromPathsEither supports sparse NODE_INDEX label payloads 0.012s
  + loadFromPathsEither rejects payload labels missing from the GIFTI LabelTable 0.004s
